<!--
  What a Guide page shows in its body while its screen is still being sized
  out of sight (2026-11-10, Austen: "we have this gorgeous mandala loading
  screen in the app, but nothing here"). It is the app's boot mandala (the
  Overture's "IΨ-IΨ-IΨ-IΨ-" scene from static/boot/overture-pool.json, its
  tip paths simplified to smooth curves), drawn as plain SVG so it is
  in the server's HTML and moves before any script runs.

  Both hands trace their paths, hold the finished figure, and clear it ahead
  of the next pass, while the whole figure turns slowly. The turn is a
  transform on its own layer, so it keeps moving while the page's script
  boots and the main thread is busy; nothing that waits on the app stands
  still. It fades in only after a short delay, so a page that is ready at
  once never flashes it.
-->
